---
const items = [
  ['yassergandhi.dev', 'When the product stops guiding, the organization starts paying for the missing scaffold elsewhere.'],
  ['huhuGERMAN', 'When the classroom stops guiding, German becomes consequence.'],
  ['Fernweh Together', 'Forthcoming. When the platform only gives a link, the shared experience can disappear before it reaches the other person.'],
];
---
<section id="ecosystem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Ecosystem</div>
    <h2>One signature. Three moments where guidance disappears.</h2>
    <div class="friction-grid ecosystem-grid">{items.map(([title, copy]) => <div class="friction-card"><strong>{title}</strong><span>{copy}</span></div>)}</div>
    <p class="section-copy ecosystem-line">When the system stops guiding, the real design begins.</p>
  </div>
</section>
